1
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:20,660
I don't remember where my house is.

2
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,210
Take me to Yoo Jung.

3
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:24,800
Yoo Jung's worried about you. Get in the car.

4
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,610
You still remember that?

5
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:30,500
Of course.

6
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:35,550
You thought I don't know that you make Yoo Jung your scapegoat?

7
00:01:11,030 --> 00:01:12,560
Driver!

8
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,120
Kang Yoo Jung!

9
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,220
Driver!

10
00:01:58,250 --> 00:01:59,860
Driver!

11
00:02:09,790 --> 00:02:11,860
What are you doing?

12
00:03:16,050 --> 00:03:17,690
What are you doing here at this time?

13
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:35,570
What's going on, Do Hoon?

14
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:40,580
- I'll make some tea. - Wait!

15
00:03:46,540 --> 00:03:49,370
Can you stay like this for a moment?

16
00:04:55,050 --> 00:04:57,130
I'm sorry.

17
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:48,590
You tend to come to others' house a lot.

18
00:05:49,470 --> 00:05:52,890
- I'm sorry. - What now?

19
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:06,650
I'm sorry you had to see me like this.

20
00:06:08,330 --> 00:06:17,000
I'm not the only one who's lost a loved one.

21
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:23,760
My father and San are gone.

22
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:29,790
I hate myself for being alive like this.

23
00:06:31,690 --> 00:06:37,160
I think I know how much you hate me.

24
00:06:39,570 --> 00:06:41,890
At least you know.

25
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:47,230
You helped me keep going.

26
00:06:48,450 --> 00:06:52,050
I didn't have the courage to kill myself...

27
00:06:54,300 --> 00:07:03,190
So I found you and complained about you, and then I get through it.

28
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:20,350
Look at me and get through it.

29
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:54,540
What makes you so upset?

30
00:07:56,590 --> 00:07:58,690
People.

31
00:08:01,770 --> 00:08:05,430
I became a prosecutor while others made sacrifices.

32
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:09,680
I get this high by my own efforts.

33
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:15,220
But there are always people born above me.

34
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:22,020
I have abandoned everything to make this high,

35
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:24,790
the people who makde sacrifices have put obstacle in my way.

36
00:08:24,790 --> 00:08:27,780
People of higher status are not that comfortable as well.

37
00:08:27,780 --> 00:08:30,230
You might think that I'm being whiny,

38
00:08:30,230 --> 00:08:33,440
but I gave up a lot of things to meet my parents' expectations.

39
00:08:33,810 --> 00:08:39,180
- If you knew that... - I know. We both gave up something,

40
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:42,340
but what we had at the beginning were different.

41
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:44,580
Has the world ever been equal?

42
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:46,740
Never.

43
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:49,060
However, if you waste your time complaining,

44
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:51,280
you're a foolish man.

45
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:56,980
Thank you for your advice.

46
00:08:58,310 --> 00:09:00,660
This is not advice.

47
00:09:00,690 --> 00:09:03,390
I'm trying to encourage you not to give up.

48
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:14,020
Yoo Jung! Hey!

49
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:15,960
Hi!

50
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:23,060
- We have to go to check the shopping mall. - I know.

51
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:29,880
Kwang Soo, how do you think she is?

52
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:37,540
- What? Has something happened? - Nothing.

53
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:39,400
Let's go.

54
00:09:40,790 --> 00:09:43,200
This is my day off. How could you do this to me?

55
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,290
Hae Ri, just for today.

56
00:09:45,290 --> 00:09:48,910
When you need a day off, I'll fill in for you.

57
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:52,050
What happened? You look terrible.

58
00:09:52,050 --> 00:09:54,650
You didn't even come home last night.

59
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,680
Never mind. I have to go.

60
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,680
Thank you.

61
00:10:23,770 --> 00:10:27,200
Let's go back. I'm worried about Yoo Jung.

62
00:10:27,450 --> 00:10:29,480
What happened?

63
00:10:29,660 --> 00:10:31,510
She's acting like nothing happened.

64
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,310
It's even worse.

65
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:39,560
I've seen people like her before.

66
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:42,780
It makes me worried. Turn the car around.

67
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,330
Yes, sir.

68
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:04,650
Manager!

69
00:11:04,870 --> 00:11:06,360
- Yes, sir. - Hello.

70
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:09,090
I don't see Kang Yoo Jung.

71
00:11:09,970 --> 00:11:13,170
She said she has somethign urgent to do, so she switched with Hae Ri.

72
00:11:19,700 --> 00:11:20,930
Where is Kang Yoo Jung?

73
00:11:21,130 --> 00:11:23,450
Well, I don't know.

74
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:25,140
How come you don't know?

75
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:28,070
I asked her, but she didn't answer.

76
00:11:28,390 --> 00:11:31,010
She just asked me to change shift with her.

77
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:48,080
This is our phone number right here.

78
00:11:48,260 --> 00:11:49,580
When a patient is missing,

79
00:11:49,730 --> 00:11:52,560
whoever finds him, will contact us.

80
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:56,320
My father was wearing this as well,

81
00:11:56,760 --> 00:12:00,280
but it went missing.

82
00:12:00,490 --> 00:12:02,400
He couldn't take it off on his own.

83
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:04,200
Look at this.

84
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:09,100
Can you check if anyone called?

85
00:12:09,290 --> 00:12:11,860
If anyone had, we would've called you.

86
00:12:12,710 --> 00:12:16,780
His contact is Mr. Ahn Do Hoon. Is that correct?

87
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,880
I'll be right up.

88
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:32,170
Okay.

89
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:36,480
What do you want?

90
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:38,720
We're not supposed to meet again.

91
00:12:38,890 --> 00:12:41,650
I do. Come with me.

92
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,530
I'm busy. I have a meeting.

93
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:52,900
This is more urgent. Come with me.

94
00:12:57,140 --> 00:12:58,870
Sir! Are you okay?

95
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,560
We need to talk.

96
00:13:00,730 --> 00:13:01,310
Get her out of here.

97
00:13:01,470 --> 00:13:02,150
Do Hoon!

98
00:13:02,310 --> 00:13:03,160
Now!

99
00:13:03,310 --> 00:13:07,710
Do Hoon! Do Hoon...

100
00:13:08,810 --> 00:13:11,720
Do Hoon! Do Hoon!

101
00:13:12,130 --> 00:13:20,160
Do Hoon! Do Hoon! Let me go.

102
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:28,420
She's not here. Why can't you trust me?

103
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,560
Where is she, then?

104
00:13:29,730 --> 00:13:30,940
That's what I want to ask you.

105
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:34,030
She hasn't come home for 2 days.

106
00:13:36,130 --> 00:13:38,200
What happened to her?

107
00:13:38,390 --> 00:13:40,050
You must know where she is.

108
00:13:41,090 --> 00:13:43,120
I guess something happened and she wants to hide herself.

109
00:13:43,290 --> 00:13:46,640
She's been in a mess, why can't you leave her alone?

110
00:14:52,710 --> 00:14:54,560
What do you want?

111
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:58,090
When I found my father in Pohang,

112
00:14:58,890 --> 00:15:01,010
the bracelet was missing.

113
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:04,170
I mean his bracelet.

114
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,710
You said he couldn't take it off on his own.

115
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:10,420
Why are you telling me this?

116
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:16,420
Because you saw my father on that day.

117
00:15:17,750 --> 00:15:18,650
Didn't you?

118
00:15:18,850 --> 00:15:20,240
Yes, I did.

119
00:15:21,930 --> 00:15:23,800
I put him in the car,

120
00:15:24,010 --> 00:15:26,260
but he was struggling to get out.

121
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:30,130
It was too dangerous, so I pulled over.

122
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:32,890
And he ran away.

123
00:15:34,330 --> 00:15:35,630
You're lying.

124
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:38,210
It was raining and there were too many people to find him.

125
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:41,870
Are you trying to blame me?

126
00:15:42,050 --> 00:15:42,890
You're lying.

127
00:15:43,070 --> 00:15:44,490
So what?

128
00:15:44,700 --> 00:15:48,520
What if I really abandoned your father in the wilderness?

129
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:53,740
It's you who didn't take care of him.

130
00:15:54,150 --> 00:15:57,040
It's you who didn't listen to me to send him to sanatorium.

131
00:15:57,300 --> 00:16:00,430
Your stubbornness made this happen.

132
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:08,130
My father trusted you.

133
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:11,430
I know. I was sick of it.

134
00:16:12,110 --> 00:16:16,720
I didn't continute to find him, so what?

135
00:16:20,870 --> 00:16:22,370
Stop the car!

136
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:27,970
Stop the car!

137
00:16:28,810 --> 00:16:30,310
Stop the car!

138
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:34,310
I told you to stop the car.

139
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:01,790
Are you crazy?

140
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,650
It could've caused an accident.

141
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:06,880
Why did you do that?

142
00:17:08,930 --> 00:17:11,480
How could you do this to me?

143
00:17:12,050 --> 00:17:14,060
How could you?

144
00:17:14,470 --> 00:17:16,430
To me and my father?

145
00:17:26,840 --> 00:17:29,300
Were you sick of San?

146
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:33,390
Is that why you took him?

147
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,970
You took him away,

148
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:40,200
and let him die just like that?

149
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:42,470
What?

150
00:17:43,370 --> 00:17:45,730
You're completely out of your mind.

151
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:58,810
Get out! Get out!

152
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:06,550
How can I possibly not go insane?

153
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:11,160
How can you be sane?

154
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,550
Kneel down!

155
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:20,390
Apologize to San and my father.

156
00:18:20,690 --> 00:18:22,690
Kneel down and beg for forgiveneess.

157
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:28,990
If I kneel down and apologize,

158
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:32,390
will you disappear forever?

159
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:41,530
I don't want to look back on the past.

160
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:44,720
You're always there.

161
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:47,910
And you keep on holding me back.

162
00:18:48,620 --> 00:18:50,460
Hold you back?

163
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,540
I said

164
00:18:52,820 --> 00:18:55,760
I'd make you happy.

165
00:18:56,250 --> 00:18:58,040
I was being arrogant.

166
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:01,190
You said you wouldn't regret it.

167
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,790
I'm regretting it.

168
00:19:04,290 --> 00:19:09,520
When you decided to go to jail for me,

169
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:12,080
if I abandoned you at that time,

170
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:15,450
we wouldn't have come this far.

171
00:19:21,470 --> 00:19:26,860
You'll regret it from now on.

172
00:19:27,850 --> 00:19:33,460
I'll tear you apart and make your life a living hell.

173
00:19:34,250 --> 00:19:36,660
Wait and see.

174
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:42,410
You'll never forget me, San,

175
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:46,790
and my father who treated you as his own son.

176
00:19:47,050 --> 00:19:50,140
I won't let you forget.

177
00:19:51,170 --> 00:19:53,490
You want me to disappear?

178
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:57,050
Not a chance!

179
00:19:57,660 --> 00:20:00,350
I'll follow you wherever you go.

180
00:20:00,860 --> 00:20:03,760
You'll see me everywhere.

181
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:08,160
Don't even think about running away.

182
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,830
Why do you come to me?

183
00:22:08,340 --> 00:22:16,280
I want to stay with you.

184
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:19,020
Why?

185
00:22:19,290 --> 00:22:21,430
I have something to do.

186
00:22:22,700 --> 00:22:25,390
Something I must do.

187
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:29,530
Do you think that I'll help you without knowing what's going on?

188
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:36,780
As you wish, I'll lead an unhappy life.

189
00:22:37,970 --> 00:22:44,290
I'll live the most miserable life.

190
00:22:45,470 --> 00:22:47,530
Please.

191
00:22:49,530 --> 00:22:51,990
Why should I help you?

192
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:54,510
Is it because of Ahn Do Hoon?

193
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:09,440
You tried to protect at the risk of your life last time,

194
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:11,680
why the sudden change of heart?

195
00:23:13,010 --> 00:23:19,880
It's the only thing I can do for the people I've lost.

196
00:23:20,860 --> 00:23:24,750
I can't get back what he took from me,

197
00:23:24,750 --> 00:23:28,090
but I can take what's his.

198
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:49,890
I'll tear you apart and make your life a living hell.

199
00:23:49,890 --> 00:23:55,530
- Say thank you. - Watch me.

200
00:23:55,530 --> 00:23:57,880
I won't let you forget me,

201
00:23:57,880 --> 00:24:03,590
- San, and my father who treated you as his own son. - Father.

202
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:10,990
You shouldn't do that. Do Hoon.

203
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:17,290
I'll follow you wherever you go.

204
00:24:17,290 --> 00:24:20,490
You'll see me everywhere.

205
00:24:25,100 --> 00:24:33,310
I won't regret it. I won't look back on the past, Yoo Jung!

206
00:24:40,990 --> 00:24:44,290
I want to destroy Ahn Do Hoon as well.

207
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:47,610
That's not diffcult.

208
00:24:47,610 --> 00:24:50,250
Should I take everything away from him?

209
00:24:50,250 --> 00:24:53,430
I can kick him out of the K Corporation.

210
00:24:54,120 --> 00:25:02,970
You've taken everything away from me. Does it make you feel good?

211
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:10,390
If you take everything away at once,

212
00:25:10,390 --> 00:25:14,580
he won't suffer enough to realize what he's done to me.

213
00:25:15,020 --> 00:25:19,370
Then, why do you need me?

214
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:29,030
You'll make him vicious.

215
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:36,860
And that'll make me strong.

216
00:25:36,860 --> 00:25:40,450
So that if he ask me to forgive him and think about our past,

217
00:25:40,450 --> 00:25:42,820
I won't back down.

218
00:26:09,290 --> 00:26:16,520
What has he done to you?

219
00:26:18,150 --> 00:26:24,980
Kwang Soo, find out what Yoo Jung did

220
00:26:24,980 --> 00:26:28,920
and who she met this week.

221
00:26:29,360 --> 00:26:30,970
Ja Yeong.

222
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:39,800
Do we have any food?

223
00:26:40,420 --> 00:26:43,250
You haven't come home for 2 days, and now you just come back and ask me for food?

224
00:26:43,280 --> 00:26:45,400
Tell me what happened.

225
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:47,270
I'm hungry.

226
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:50,110
I need to eat first.

227
00:26:50,150 --> 00:26:53,750
I need energy to do things.

228
00:26:54,610 --> 00:26:57,480
I made bean curd soup.

229
00:26:58,770 --> 00:27:00,850
Come in.

230
00:27:13,190 --> 00:27:18,770
By the end of the year, we'll finish the renewal of the check-in system at our branches worldwide.

231
00:27:18,770 --> 00:27:23,390
The facilities of our hotels at home...

232
00:27:24,870 --> 00:27:27,280
I've read related flies.

233
00:27:27,320 --> 00:27:29,840
Then why did you want to see me?

234
00:27:29,870 --> 00:27:31,840
You want to know?

235
00:27:35,100 --> 00:27:38,080
I'm not good at beating around the bush.

236
00:27:38,950 --> 00:27:42,160
What's going on between you and Yoo Jung?

237
00:27:43,190 --> 00:27:48,340
What have you done to her to make her turn her back on you?

238
00:27:48,340 --> 00:27:52,380
If it's not related to business, I'll leave now.

239
00:27:52,380 --> 00:27:53,840
Mr. Ahn.

240
00:27:55,990 --> 00:28:00,320
You were with Kang Yoo Jung on the day of the accident.

241
00:28:00,320 --> 00:28:03,590
You share secrets more precious than life

242
00:28:03,660 --> 00:28:05,380
and now you've turned against each other?

243
00:28:05,420 --> 00:28:07,790
I'm really curious about what happened.

244
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:12,780
Neither of you want to tell me the reasons behind it.

245
00:28:13,260 --> 00:28:14,940
Kwang Soo!

246
00:28:14,970 --> 00:28:16,020
Yes, sir!

247
00:28:16,050 --> 00:28:18,240
Are you checking into it?

248
00:28:18,980 --> 00:28:22,620
The black box footage will be recovered soon.

249
00:28:22,620 --> 00:28:24,160
Good.

250
00:28:27,080 --> 00:28:29,540
I'll see you at the board meeting.

251
00:28:35,420 --> 00:28:40,790
Se Yeon will be there, right?

252
00:28:40,830 --> 00:28:46,010
Does Se Yeon know about you and Kang Yoo Jung?

253
00:28:46,010 --> 00:28:50,110
I warned you not to see Se Yeon as you wish.

254
00:28:50,110 --> 00:28:51,890
Don't forget that.

255
00:29:29,410 --> 00:29:33,970
I'll introduce you my new parter, who will help me with the new startup,

256
00:29:34,010 --> 00:29:36,280
and the development of King's Restaurant.

257
00:29:41,390 --> 00:29:43,520
I'm Kang Yoo Jung.

258
00:29:58,020 --> 00:30:03,320
Are you qualified to attend a board meeting now?

259
00:30:07,210 --> 00:30:12,920
Mr. Jo isn't familiar with the restaurant menu, so I came along.

260
00:30:13,780 --> 00:30:15,620
Please don't get the wrong ideas.

261
00:30:16,050 --> 00:30:18,530
You said the same thing before.

262
00:30:19,450 --> 00:30:21,990
How else am I supposed to react?

263
00:30:22,020 --> 00:30:26,480
You give me reasons to get the wrong ideas.

264
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:32,050
What's the real reason for you to stay with Min Hyuk?

265
00:30:41,230 --> 00:30:43,630
Will you excuse me?

266
00:30:52,700 --> 00:30:57,280
Is this what you were talking about?

267
00:30:57,310 --> 00:31:01,850
You want to use Jo Min Hyuk to upgrade your status?

268
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:08,050
Is that how you made it this far?

269
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:18,760
We are not like Mr.An and you,

270
00:31:18,760 --> 00:31:20,830
I just need a partner.

271
00:31:20,830 --> 00:31:23,810
You are crazy.

272
00:31:25,180 --> 00:31:28,800
You're well aware of who she is.

273
00:31:29,230 --> 00:31:36,030
If you find out who Mr. Ahn really is, you'll change your mind.

274
00:31:38,140 --> 00:31:39,970
Let's go.

275
00:32:06,250 --> 00:32:08,740
Come to work at my place tomorrow.

276
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:10,560
Again?

277
00:32:10,560 --> 00:32:13,170
I told you not to question me.

278
00:32:14,290 --> 00:32:15,770
Yes, sir.

279
00:32:20,840 --> 00:32:23,110
Was that good enough?

280
00:32:23,670 --> 00:32:25,740
You should be more resolute,

281
00:32:26,470 --> 00:32:28,830
when stand in front of him.

282
00:32:28,860 --> 00:32:30,190
I will.

283
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:36,130
Thank you.

284
00:32:42,760 --> 00:32:47,070
What do they want to do?

285
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:50,160
If he brought her to get your attention,

286
00:32:51,180 --> 00:32:55,080
I guess it worked.

287
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:57,420
This is very annoying.

288
00:32:58,340 --> 00:33:01,970
If that's what you want,

289
00:33:02,530 --> 00:33:05,360
I'll separate them.

290
00:33:32,690 --> 00:33:34,570
What is this?

291
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:48,600
We need to prevent it from being published.

292
00:33:49,330 --> 00:33:51,140
What's going on?

293
00:33:52,100 --> 00:33:53,780
Everyone knows about it

294
00:33:53,780 --> 00:33:56,480
except me.

295
00:33:57,140 --> 00:33:59,050
When will my father come back?

296
00:33:59,050 --> 00:34:03,320
Executive Director Im and I will co-sign to get the 20 million dollars from K Capital.

297
00:34:03,320 --> 00:34:04,960
We should stabilize the price of our shares first...

298
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:06,940
What did my father say?

299
00:34:08,650 --> 00:34:10,950
Why did he go to Germany?

300
00:34:11,490 --> 00:34:12,770
What for?

301
00:34:12,770 --> 00:34:15,010
I can't tell him, yet.

302
00:34:15,010 --> 00:34:18,430
No one could reach him during his operation.

303
00:34:18,450 --> 00:34:20,520
Operation?

304
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:25,470
How can I know nothing about that as his only son?

305
00:34:25,470 --> 00:34:28,650
While he's absent, you're the head of the K Corporation.

306
00:34:28,650 --> 00:34:32,420
If you knew that, how come you didn't tell me?

307
00:34:41,010 --> 00:34:42,630
The K Hotel.

308
00:34:43,910 --> 00:34:45,680
Buy shares in the K Hotel.

309
00:34:45,680 --> 00:34:48,120
It's my father's first business.

310
00:34:48,490 --> 00:34:50,150
How's my father?

311
00:34:50,150 --> 00:34:51,760
They'll contact me soon.

312
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:53,690
You have to get back to the hotel right now.

313
00:34:53,690 --> 00:34:55,860
Prove to them that you're the legitimate heir.

314
00:34:55,860 --> 00:35:01,890
That's why my father wanted me to make a profit from the restaurant chain?

315
00:35:02,500 --> 00:35:08,150
Your father and the K Corporation won't fold that easily.

316
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:19,980
If you find out anything, tell me.

317
00:35:35,040 --> 00:35:41,510
Kang Yoo Jung... She's the one who killed Min Hyuk's girlfriend.

318
00:35:41,510 --> 00:35:45,500
He knows it and still keeps her around.

319
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:49,800
How hateful they are.

320
00:35:51,940 --> 00:35:54,810
I thought I knew Min Hyuk,

321
00:35:54,810 --> 00:35:57,410
but I'm not so sure now.

322
00:35:57,410 --> 00:36:00,230
He's obsessed with Yoo Jung

323
00:36:01,520 --> 00:36:04,540
like he was with Seo Ji Hee.

324
00:36:06,640 --> 00:36:08,910
Don't you have something to tell me?

325
00:36:08,910 --> 00:36:10,450
Yes.

326
00:36:14,030 --> 00:36:20,390
I told you I once loved someone,

327
00:36:23,370 --> 00:36:27,250
and I want to forget her,

328
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:33,700
The woman is Kang Yoo Jung.

329
00:36:39,850 --> 00:36:40,750
Do Hoon.

330
00:36:40,750 --> 00:36:43,150
I didn't want others find it out.

331
00:36:43,150 --> 00:36:44,780
In front of me and Min Hyuk,

332
00:36:44,780 --> 00:36:47,090
you've pretended that you didn't know her.

333
00:36:47,090 --> 00:36:51,370
Min Hyuk knew about us all along.

334
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:59,580
The three of you have made a complete fool out of me.

335
00:36:59,580 --> 00:37:01,380
I didn't mean to,

336
00:37:01,380 --> 00:37:06,480
but I'm guilty that I lied to you.

337
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:08,320
I'm sorry.

338
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:11,170
You'sorry?

339
00:37:14,280 --> 00:37:15,720
That's easy.

340
00:37:15,720 --> 00:37:18,070
I didn't know this would happen.

341
00:37:18,070 --> 00:37:20,280
Yoo Jung and I were done long time ago.

342
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:24,730
The way that Min Hyuk's been treating Yoo Jung...

343
00:37:25,830 --> 00:37:27,830
You're the same.

344
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:31,440
Men are the same.

345
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,040
I used to hope that you were different.

346
00:37:33,040 --> 00:37:35,920
I was wrong.

347
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:39,310
Se Yeon!

348
00:37:39,330 --> 00:37:42,740
You've fooled me for such a long time.

349
00:37:42,740 --> 00:37:45,380
Don't make excuses.

350
00:37:45,380 --> 00:37:48,420
I don't want to hear anymore.

351
00:38:00,330 --> 00:38:01,760
Ah.

352
00:38:05,690 --> 00:38:08,230
Drink something warm.

353
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,960
Here you are.

354
00:38:10,570 --> 00:38:12,800
It's hot.

355
00:38:19,250 --> 00:38:23,660
When wer had no work in jail,

356
00:38:23,660 --> 00:38:25,620
do you remember what you said?

357
00:38:25,620 --> 00:38:26,670
What?

358
00:38:26,670 --> 00:38:30,220
If we persist, 1 minute turns into 1 hour,

359
00:38:30,220 --> 00:38:33,010
1 hour turns into 1 month.

360
00:38:33,010 --> 00:38:37,130
No matter how slow it seems to go, time passes.

361
00:38:38,570 --> 00:38:42,550
Everybody was talking about their past...

362
00:38:42,550 --> 00:38:46,340
Hey, all they said about their past were lies.

363
00:38:46,340 --> 00:38:48,640
They did it to pass the time.

364
00:38:48,640 --> 00:38:54,160
I always thought about the future at that time.

365
00:38:55,310 --> 00:39:01,550
I thought thinking about the past seemed silly.

366
00:39:02,560 --> 00:39:04,600
If I think of San and my father...

367
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:07,690
Stop thinking of something strange.

368
00:39:07,690 --> 00:39:10,540
It's a waste of life to hate other people.

369
00:39:10,540 --> 00:39:13,810
That's the stupidest thing ever.

370
00:39:14,760 --> 00:39:22,300
There are so many people who get away with doing terrible things.

371
00:39:23,740 --> 00:39:26,320
That's strange, right?

372
00:39:26,630 --> 00:39:29,430
That's not fair, isn't it?

373
00:39:30,020 --> 00:39:34,070
The Fried Rice Cake is done, come and eat.

374
00:39:49,300 --> 00:39:53,460
Yoo Jung, what's going on between you and Min Hyuk?

375
00:39:54,210 --> 00:39:58,120
I mean, Do Hoon dumped you, and...

376
00:39:58,120 --> 00:40:01,200
Why don't you just go out with Min Hyuk?

377
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:03,200
Hey!

378
00:40:03,200 --> 00:40:06,490
You are so idealistic.

379
00:40:06,490 --> 00:40:11,340
Yoo Jung, I heard he's getting married soon.

380
00:40:11,340 --> 00:40:15,170
It's illegal to have a relationship with a married man.

381
00:40:15,170 --> 00:40:16,140
Illegal?

382
00:40:16,140 --> 00:40:17,750
If you know that,

383
00:40:17,750 --> 00:40:21,480
why are you going out with a married man?

384
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:24,540
Hey! How dare you!

385
00:40:24,700 --> 00:40:27,920
He said he could live without the sun, but not without me.

386
00:40:27,920 --> 00:40:30,100
We're so much in love with each other.

387
00:40:30,100 --> 00:40:31,440
Anyway,

388
00:40:31,440 --> 00:40:32,820
you can't go out with him.

389
00:40:32,820 --> 00:40:34,030
You're involved with him for the wrong reasons.

390
00:40:34,030 --> 00:40:35,530
You won't have a happy ending together.

391
00:40:35,530 --> 00:40:37,050
So what?

392
00:40:37,050 --> 00:40:38,770
We' re not animal.

393
00:40:38,770 --> 00:40:41,070
I don't think he'll go ahead with this arranged marriage.

394
00:40:41,070 --> 00:40:43,610
Besides, Mr. Jo doesn't care about that woman.

395
00:40:43,610 --> 00:40:44,950
Really?

396
00:40:44,950 --> 00:40:47,230
Don't worry. Nothing's going to happen.

397
00:40:47,230 --> 00:40:50,180
Stop pretending.

398
00:40:50,180 --> 00:40:52,580
Then why are you staying with him?

399
00:40:52,580 --> 00:40:54,120
Because you like him, right?

400
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:57,290
Stop the nonsense!

401
00:40:57,290 --> 00:40:58,810
The rice cake tastes strange.

402
00:40:58,810 --> 00:41:01,120
Remake it.

403
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:03,290
Come on.

404
00:41:03,290 --> 00:41:05,070
Bring some sugar.

405
00:41:05,070 --> 00:41:07,080
- Just sugar? - Yes.

406
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:16,650
There was a girl who came to see Yoo Jung.

407
00:41:22,950 --> 00:41:27,360
Lee Hye Jin. She was Yoo Jung's cellmate.

408
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:28,340
So?

409
00:41:28,340 --> 00:41:33,230
She reported Yoo Jung for maltreating her son.

410
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:36,710
Three days ago, Ja Yeong went to the police

411
00:41:36,710 --> 00:41:40,890
asking for the surveillance camera footages near Yoo Jung's bakery.

412
00:41:40,890 --> 00:41:43,060
Bakery? When?

413
00:41:43,060 --> 00:41:45,260
It's a parking surveillance camera,

414
00:41:45,260 --> 00:41:49,760
and she got the footage from the day his father went missing.

415
00:41:49,760 --> 00:41:53,470
Her son and her father.

416
00:41:58,530 --> 00:42:01,660
Find her. At all costs.

417
00:42:01,950 --> 00:42:05,590
And bring me that camera footage as well.

418
00:42:05,590 --> 00:42:07,220
Yes, sir.

419
00:42:27,790 --> 00:42:33,310
I once loved someone, that's Kang Yoo Jung.

420
00:42:37,140 --> 00:42:40,820
What's the real reason you're with Min Hyuk?

421
00:42:40,820 --> 00:42:43,970
We're not like you and Mr. Ahn.

422
00:42:43,970 --> 00:42:46,920
I just need a partner.

423
00:43:34,430 --> 00:43:37,970
I thought you just killed someone by mistake,

424
00:43:37,970 --> 00:43:41,530
but you're much worse than that.

425
00:43:42,440 --> 00:43:45,820
Do Hoon told me that you were his girlfriend.

426
00:43:48,160 --> 00:43:52,890
What are you trying to do with these two men?

427
00:43:52,890 --> 00:43:55,810
Sorry, I didn't mean to disturb you.

428
00:43:55,810 --> 00:43:59,630
Yet, you still come to my house.

429
00:43:59,630 --> 00:44:01,880
I have something to do.

430
00:44:01,880 --> 00:44:06,970
I need to pay my debt to Min Hyuk,

431
00:44:06,970 --> 00:44:12,100
and get some things from Do Hoon.

432
00:44:12,120 --> 00:44:18,970
You're sorry, but you're still going to be around?

433
00:44:19,130 --> 00:44:20,990
I'm afraid so.

434
00:44:21,210 --> 00:44:23,540
Okay. Go ahead.

435
00:44:24,070 --> 00:44:27,510
I can get rid of a leech.

436
00:44:39,940 --> 00:44:41,730
So

437
00:44:41,730 --> 00:44:44,170
Why can't we have this profitabe restaurant?

438
00:44:44,170 --> 00:44:47,710
Se Gwang is showing great interest in the King's Restaurant.

439
00:44:47,710 --> 00:44:52,020
This is the only company that we can cash in on

440
00:44:52,020 --> 00:44:53,440
at the moment.

441
00:44:53,440 --> 00:44:57,560
You're selling it to Se Gwang?

442
00:44:58,440 --> 00:45:01,600
Mr. Ahn, who're you working for?

443
00:45:01,600 --> 00:45:04,240
The profits you made so far,

444
00:45:04,240 --> 00:45:06,850
isn't enough to get the board

445
00:45:06,850 --> 00:45:08,680
to permit more investments.

446
00:45:08,680 --> 00:45:11,990
Since when do I need your permission?

447
00:45:14,020 --> 00:45:16,890
The K Hotel shares that you have

448
00:45:16,890 --> 00:45:19,360
don't exceed what Se Yeon and the board have.

449
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:24,550
All the decisions are made by the board members.

450
00:45:47,110 --> 00:45:49,100
What do you think?

451
00:45:49,560 --> 00:45:53,830
I brought one since you're too busy to come and see it.

452
00:45:57,720 --> 00:46:00,340
She sure is something.

453
00:46:01,230 --> 00:46:05,010
She said she has a debt to pay to Min Hyuk,

454
00:46:05,010 --> 00:46:09,460
and some things to get from you.

455
00:46:15,030 --> 00:46:20,970
Do you still have feelings for her?

456
00:46:20,970 --> 00:46:23,210
No.

457
00:46:23,210 --> 00:46:27,170
Did you mean it

458
00:46:27,170 --> 00:46:28,500
when you said you wanted to forget her?

459
00:46:28,500 --> 00:46:32,250
Yes, I already have.

460
00:46:32,750 --> 00:46:39,400
That's enough. The past is past.

461
00:46:40,910 --> 00:46:44,980
You said you could separate them.

462
00:47:00,640 --> 00:47:02,790
Do it for me.

463
00:47:14,470 --> 00:47:17,710
Thank you for telling me the truth,

464
00:47:18,110 --> 00:47:21,120
You respect me.

465
00:47:24,820 --> 00:47:26,730
Thank you.

466
00:47:36,850 --> 00:47:39,440
It's strange.

467
00:47:39,440 --> 00:47:41,500
You came back till midnight.

468
00:47:41,500 --> 00:47:43,020
I was busy working.

469
00:47:43,020 --> 00:47:47,980
So, what was it that kept you so busy?

470
00:47:50,290 --> 00:47:54,280
Something that concerns both you and me. Our restaurant.

471
00:47:56,780 --> 00:47:58,550
Are you going home with me today?

472
00:47:58,550 --> 00:48:01,990
No! I have work to do.

473
00:48:06,910 --> 00:48:10,570
I'm glad that things between you and Mr. Jo are going well,

474
00:48:10,570 --> 00:48:12,850
but you shouldn't be too obedient.

475
00:48:12,850 --> 00:48:14,130
Do you know that?

476
00:48:14,130 --> 00:48:17,010
- Hae Ri? - Yes. You know?

477
00:48:23,470 --> 00:48:27,970
Since when do you try to sell a company that's still making profits?

478
00:48:27,970 --> 00:48:29,470
Especially to Se Gwang?

479
00:48:29,470 --> 00:48:33,730
I don't think you're qualified to attend this meeting.

480
00:48:33,730 --> 00:48:36,480
- What? - You're dismissed.

481
00:48:36,480 --> 00:48:39,780
You can't attend this meeting.

482
00:48:47,460 --> 00:48:49,080
Ahn Do Hoon!

483
00:48:50,740 --> 00:48:56,150
Let go of me!

484
00:48:56,150 --> 00:48:57,230
Let go of me!

485
00:48:57,230 --> 00:48:58,500
Get him out of here.

486
00:48:58,500 --> 00:49:00,040
Yes.

487
00:49:01,000 --> 00:49:06,300
Let go of me, I said let go of me.

488
00:49:08,970 --> 00:49:13,360
I'm Jo Min Hyuk! I'm the owner of this company.

489
00:49:20,690 --> 00:49:24,230
The board meeting... How did it go?

490
00:49:24,230 --> 00:49:27,950
Is that why you came to see me?

491
00:49:27,950 --> 00:49:32,270
Why don't you chsh your shares in and invest in me?

492
00:49:32,270 --> 00:49:37,430
Why should I? We're not even friends.

493
00:49:38,640 --> 00:49:40,320
What's your collateral?

494
00:49:40,320 --> 00:49:44,420
It happens all the time. It'll eventually pass.

495
00:49:44,420 --> 00:49:46,350
When my father finds out what you've been up to...

496
00:49:46,350 --> 00:49:48,790
I can defend myself.

497
00:49:48,790 --> 00:49:53,100
You're the one who's been hanging out with another girl.

498
00:49:53,100 --> 00:49:56,990
That alone could disqualify you from being my fiance..

499
00:49:57,660 --> 00:49:59,900
I'm not like your mother,

500
00:49:59,900 --> 00:50:02,270
I'm not that obedient.

501
00:50:02,270 --> 00:50:03,260
You should know that.

502
00:50:03,260 --> 00:50:04,260
Shin Se Yeon!

503
00:50:04,260 --> 00:50:07,020
Stop yelling at me!

504
00:50:07,750 --> 00:50:10,480
Both you and Kang Yoo Jung are insane.

505
00:50:10,480 --> 00:50:14,330
I'm trying to make you come to your senses before you completely mess up.

506
00:50:14,330 --> 00:50:16,850
You should thank me.

507
00:50:18,790 --> 00:50:23,120
Send Kang Yoo Jung away.

508
00:50:23,950 --> 00:50:26,960
Then, I'll consider your request.

509
00:50:27,550 --> 00:50:31,460
I thought you were desperate.

510
00:50:44,980 --> 00:50:54,070
Don't you ever mention my mother again.

511
00:51:26,550 --> 00:51:30,920
Jae Ha. Where are you?

512
00:51:32,000 --> 00:51:34,260
Why?

513
00:51:34,260 --> 00:51:38,650
I'm going to give you the apology that you've been waiting for.

514
00:51:46,920 --> 00:51:49,030
Hey! Over here!

515
00:51:51,800 --> 00:51:55,120
What are you doing here?

516
00:51:55,120 --> 00:51:59,830
Everything goes well, I'm here to have a drink with my friend.

517
00:51:59,830 --> 00:52:01,220
Friend?

518
00:52:01,220 --> 00:52:05,420
Thanks to you, I made a good friend.

519
00:52:05,420 --> 00:52:07,220
Thank you.

520
00:52:08,010 --> 00:52:10,990
First my father,

521
00:52:10,990 --> 00:52:15,640
Se Yeon and now Jae Ha?

522
00:52:16,500 --> 00:52:18,760
You're something, Ahn Do Hoon!

523
00:52:19,100 --> 00:52:24,600
As you advised, I've been trying to make connections.

524
00:52:24,980 --> 00:52:27,750
I thought you were here to apologize.

525
00:52:28,840 --> 00:52:30,860
Drink up.

526
00:52:34,150 --> 00:52:36,840
And then apologize.

527
00:52:41,470 --> 00:52:44,940
Why didn't you bring that substandard product together with you?

528
00:52:44,940 --> 00:52:48,200
I might consider helping

529
00:52:48,200 --> 00:52:52,610
that tiny restaurant chain of yours.

530
00:52:52,610 --> 00:52:53,770
Jae Ha!

531
00:52:53,770 --> 00:52:59,000
You should've treated me better.

532
00:53:00,560 --> 00:53:04,270
We both don't have friends.

533
00:53:10,930 --> 00:53:15,210
If you're done, you can go. I want to talk to my friend alone.

534
00:53:15,880 --> 00:53:17,800
Even if he takes over your restaurant,

535
00:53:17,800 --> 00:53:21,130
all the employees will keep their jobs.

536
00:53:21,130 --> 00:53:25,070
Tell Yoo Jung not to worry about losing her job.

537
00:53:25,070 --> 00:53:30,540
By the way, I hope your father gets well soon.

538
00:54:31,390 --> 00:54:32,940
You bastard...

539
00:54:32,940 --> 00:54:36,930
You come and go as if you owned the place.

540
00:54:37,300 --> 00:54:39,670
Where is Yoo Jung?

541
00:54:39,670 --> 00:54:42,220
Do you think Yoo Jung is your pet?

542
00:54:42,220 --> 00:54:44,330
Do you think she's standing by for your call?

543
00:54:44,330 --> 00:54:45,680
Where is she?

544
00:54:45,680 --> 00:54:50,310
Stop harassing her. She works late every night.

545
00:54:51,610 --> 00:54:55,540
Why does she have to work that late?

546
00:54:57,790 --> 00:55:02,360
I'm going to report you to the police.

547
00:55:55,070 --> 00:55:56,900
Driver!

548
00:56:03,400 --> 00:56:06,010
What are you doing here?

549
00:56:06,680 --> 00:56:10,270
Sir, the new sauce tastes good.

550
00:56:10,270 --> 00:56:14,860
It goes well with meat and tastes good with salad as well.

551
00:56:14,860 --> 00:56:16,320
I think the customers will like it.

552
00:56:16,320 --> 00:56:19,050
Do you think it'll make a difference?

553
00:56:19,050 --> 00:56:20,930
If the board decides to sell this restaurant,

554
00:56:20,930 --> 00:56:22,330
we're done.

555
00:56:22,330 --> 00:56:24,270
We have to try.

556
00:56:24,270 --> 00:56:26,580
Nothing's been decided, yet.

557
00:56:37,740 --> 00:56:41,650
Do you want to taste it? I think it's good.

558
00:56:55,040 --> 00:56:56,890
Don't smile.

559
00:56:58,310 --> 00:57:04,760
Will you leave me in the end even you smile at me now?

560
00:57:06,390 --> 00:57:10,570
After getting what you want,

561
00:57:11,640 --> 00:57:14,800
you're going to leave me as well.

562
00:57:29,760 --> 00:57:33,310
You said I'll do what you ask me to do.

563
00:57:37,030 --> 00:57:41,220
Until you tell me to leave,

564
00:57:41,890 --> 00:57:44,670
I'll stay with you.

565
00:58:35,080 --> 00:58:42,320
Next on Secret Love.

566
00:58:44,420 --> 00:58:48,700
You're here, do you want to watch something fun with me?

567
00:58:48,700 --> 00:58:50,990
I was with Yoo Jung on that day.

568
00:58:50,990 --> 00:58:51,710
So what?

569
00:58:51,710 --> 00:58:53,360
Kang Yoo Jung! You!

570
00:58:53,360 --> 00:58:55,450
Did Do Hoon do it?

571
00:58:55,450 --> 00:58:58,840
Yoo Jung, you look like you're going to die soon.

572
00:58:58,840 --> 00:59:00,490
I couldn't die, even if I wanted to.

573
00:59:00,490 --> 00:59:03,590
How are you going to revenge while making food in the kitchen?

574
00:59:03,590 --> 00:59:05,280
Happy birthday to you.

575
00:59:05,280 --> 00:59:06,870
Happy birthday to you.

576
00:59:06,870 --> 00:59:08,360
Do you want to leave after dinner?

577
00:59:08,360 --> 00:59:10,880
There is no secret in the world, right?

578
00:59:10,880 --> 00:59:14,380
What happened to Yoo Jung’s father... I'll look into it later.
